WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.000
Views can help separate source data from analytical
representation The

00:00:06.027 --> 00:00:11.553
raw table preserves provenance A clean view applies
standardized

00:00:11.579 --> 00:00:19.361
transformations A quality view exposes rows that
need review Downstream

00:00:19.387 --> 00:00:25.596
analysis can use the prepared layer without
permanently overwriting the source This

00:00:25.622 --> 00:00:28.425
also makes the cleaning logic visible in SQL
